      "releaseNotes": "Dreaming of your 2026 getaway? Discover even more inspiration in the Jet2 app, along with destinations, deals and travel ideas to help plan your next escape.\nWe’ve also made behind-the-scenes improvements to keep everything running smoothly, with performance enhancements and refinements to make the app faster, more reliable and easier to use. Update now and start exploring...",
